{"id":"steam-5498190","steam":5498190,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Big Cock Inc.","summary":"A cozy farm sim where you arm your cocks with AK-47s and bet the rent on them in club fights. Breed the best chickens, steal and sell their eggs, send the rest down the conveyor to the fryer, and serve them through your own fried chicken drive-thru.","about":"Place your bet. Pray for your rooster.\n\nSend your toughest roosters to training. They come back with AK-47s, bazookas, buzzsaws or boxing gloves.\n\nAt Club Cock Torture, bet and watch the chaos. Win the pot. Birds that die are gone for good.\n\nBuild the line\n\nHang birds on transporters. Machines slaughter, cut, fry and pack them. Load the truck and count the cash.\n\nFarm getting crowded? Buy the plot next door. Research unlocks new machines and better birds.\n\nBring a bazooka to a cockfight\n\nEvery weapon fights its own way. Bazookas blast whole crowds, buzzsaws shred up close, snipers pick off the back.\n\nOne rocket can turn a winning bet into a pile of feathers.\r\n\nBreed the killers\n\nStart with a small roadside plot and a few chickens. They lay, breed, and sometimes wander into traffic.\n\nChicks inherit genes for eggs, meat, temper and looks. Pair the best and breed Common birds into Legendaries.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5498190/2e195a432a4b2709822c2af063182453cf024e7e/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794356294","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5498190/0881b8311a658082e034b3c3d52a8697ea29cb16/header.jpg?t=1794356294","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5498190/7939662a016be4f13dba06639fcb2fea0bc93b99/library_hero.jpg?t=1794356294","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5498190/0881b8311a658082e034b3c3d52a8697ea29cb16/header.jpg?t=1794356294","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5498190